				{
					"id": 250350801,
					"content": "兩份…三份…齊了。太好了，那些丟失的快捷郵件都找回來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250350802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米齊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250350802,
					"content": "…等等，這份快捷郵件是不是圖達瑪送的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250350803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米齊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250350803,
					"content": "#這些報酬給{F#妳}{M#你}，謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}幫忙。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250350804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米齊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 250350804,
					"content": "呼…我真的是要找圖達瑪這小子好好聊一下了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
